00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,570
Anjaan logo se bhare room mein akele khade ho?

2
00:00:02,570 --> 00:00:05,810
Kitni baar visiting card diya aur wo jeb mein hi kho gaya?

3
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:08,600
Ab try karo CampBuddy ka digital Camp Card.

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,360
Naam, kaam, aur ek QR code — sab ek jagah.

5
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:14,610
QR scan karo, seedha LinkedIn khul jaata hai.

6
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:17,610
Apni pasand batao, waise hi log mil jaate hain.

7
00:00:17,610 --> 00:00:21,380
Ab koi naya contact kho nahi sakta — campbuddy.club.
